SUMMARY:Deadline: workspacebrussels Studio Residencies\, August to December
  2027
DESCRIPTION:Research and creation studio residencies in Brussels for artist
 s working in the performing arts in the broad sense: dance\, performance\,
  theatre and crossovers with other disciplines (projects that are purely c
 ircus\, visual art\, music or for young audiences are excluded).\n\nOrgani
 sation: workspacebrussels\nLocation: Brussels\, Belgium. Open to Belgian a
 nd international performing artists\; guesthouse accommodation available f
 or internationals (limited availability).\nAward: EUR 750 flat fee per sel
 ected project for travel and lunch costs\, plus a free studio for one to t
 wo weeks\, basic technical equipment in some studios\, communal lunches an
 d optional work sharings. No application fee.\nDuration: 1 to 2 weeks betw
 een August and December 2027\n\nMore: https://www.workspacebrussels.be/en/
 studio-residency?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
