SUMMARY:Deadline: EMMA Kreativzentrum Pforzheim: Designers in Residence 202
 7 (EUR 1\,000/month\, 3 months)
DESCRIPTION:EMMA Kreativzentrum Pforzheim\, with Pforzheim University of Ap
 plied Sciences and the Design Center Baden-Wuerttemberg\, offers three sch
 olarships for international young designers to spend three months working 
 in Pforzheim. WHO: designers in jewellery\, fashion\, accessories\, indust
 rial design\, communication design and other design disciplines\; interdis
 ciplinary approaches are welcome.\n\nOrganisation: EMMA Kreativzentrum Pfo
 rzheim (City of Pforzheim)\, with Pforzheim University and Design Center B
 aden-Wuerttemberg\nLocation: Pforzheim\, Germany. Open to international yo
 ung designers\; no nationality restriction stated.\nAward: EUR 1\,000 per 
 month (EUR 3\,000 over the residency)\, plus material costs covered\, free
  accommodation and reimbursed travel. No application fee mentioned.\nDurat
 ion: 3 months\, 1 April to 30 June 2027\, ending with an exhibition at EMM
 A.\n\nMore: https://www.emma-pf.de/en/designers-in-residence/designers-in-
 residence-scholarship/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
