SUMMARY:Deadline: Follow Fluxus: After Fluxus Scholarship 2026/27 (EUR 10\,
 000\, 3-month studio and exhibition\, Wiesbaden)
DESCRIPTION:The Follow Fluxus scholarship\, awarded by the Nassauischer Kun
 stverein Wiesbaden and the City of Wiesbaden in memory of the Fluxus movem
 ent that began in Wiesbaden in 1962\, supports artists whose work continue
 s the open\, intermedia and experimental spirit of Fluxus.\n\nOrganisation
 : Nassauischer Kunstverein Wiesbaden\, with the City of Wiesbaden\nLocatio
 n: Wiesbaden\, Germany. Open to international and national artists.\nAward
 : EUR 10\,000 grant plus a rent-free 70.88 sqm live/work studio at the Kun
 sthaus Wiesbaden for three months and a follow-up exhibition at the Nassau
 ischer Kunstverein. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: 3 months\, 1 
 June to 31 August 2027\, followed by an exhibition.\n\nMore: https://www.k
 unstverein-wiesbaden.de/en/follow-fluxus/the-scholarship/the-selection-1?u
 tm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kunstverein-wiesbaden.de/en/follow-fluxus/the-scholarship/t
 he-selection-1?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Wiesbaden\, Germany. Open to international and national artists.
END:VEVENT
