SUMMARY:Deadline 18:00 Istanbul time: SAHA Studio Open Call\, 13th Term (Is
 tanbul\, up to TRY 200\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 14 Nov 2026 at 18:00 Istanbul time.\n\nSAHA Studio is SA
 HA Association's research and production residency in Istanbul. The 13th t
 erm selects five professionally practising visual artists (duos and collec
 tives allowed\; no medium or age requirement) for six months of studio wor
 k with a budget\, curatorial feedback\, mid-term gatherings and a closing 
 'SAHA Studio Open' presentation.\n\nOrganisation: SAHA Association\nLocati
 on: SAHA's IMC venue\, Fatih\, Istanbul\, Turkiye. No nationality rule sta
 ted\; aimed at artists working in Turkiye\, with preference for artists fr
 om outside Istanbul.\nAward: Budget of up to TRY 200\,000 per artist cover
 ing honorarium plus research\, production\, exhibition and event costs. Al
 so a personal studio for 6 months\, accommodation and transport for artist
 s from outside Istanbul\, equipment and crew support\, and curatorial\, ed
 itorial and legal counselling. 5 artists selected. No application fee.\nDu
 ration: 6 months (January to June 2027)\n\nMore: https://www.saha.org.tr/e
 n/programs/open-call-from-saha-studio-13th-term/?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.saha.org.tr/en/programs/open-call-from-saha-studio-13th-ter
 m/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:SAHA's IMC venue\, Fatih\, Istanbul\, Turkiye. No nationality rule
  stated\; aimed at artists working in Turkiye\, with preference for artist
 s from outside Istanbul.
END:VEVENT
