SUMMARY:Deadline 22:00 UTC: Mophradat x BUDA: Performance Residency with a 
 Premiere at NEXT Festival (Kortrijk\, 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 04 Jan 2027 at 22:00 UTC.\n\nPart of Mophradat's Art Tim
 e residencies: a three-week residency at BUDA in Kortrijk\, Belgium\, for 
 a performing artist from the Arab world finalising a new production\, culm
 inating in its premiere at NEXT Festival. Fields: performance\, dance and 
 interdisciplinary contemporary performance\; unconventional projects with 
 experimental forms or progressive discourses are encouraged.\n\nOrganisati
 on: Mophradat\, with BUDA Kortrijk and NEXT Festival\nLocation: BUDA\, Kor
 trijk\, Belgium (3-week residency\, premiere at NEXT Festival). For perfor
 ming artists from the Arab world.\nAward: EUR 10\,000 all-inclusive\, cove
 ring travel and visa costs\, residency per diems\, coproduction costs and 
 a presentation fee for the NEXT Festival performance. Accommodation provid
 ed. Compensation if the project cannot travel due to visa refusal. No appl
 ication fee.\nDuration: 3-week residency at BUDA\, then premiere at NEXT F
 estival (dates TBC\; project must be in final development by September 202
 7)\n\nMore: https://mophradat.org/program/art-time-residencies/performance
 /apply-buda/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://mophradat.org/program/art-time-residencies/performance/apply-bu
 da/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:BUDA\, Kortrijk\, Belgium (3-week residency\, premiere at NEXT Fes
 tival). For performing artists from the Arab world.
END:VEVENT
